      "description": "The audio reaching your VAD and STT is often noisy, reverberant, or mixed with background voices. Cleaning the signal before the rest of the pipeline is frequently the difference between an agent that ships and one that frustrates users in real-world conditions (cars, cafés, call centres). In 2026 every major voice-AI vendor ships a deep-learning suppressor on top of WebRTC's classic noise-suppression chain.",
